+# CONTRACT — CLI Time Tracker
+
+## Behaviors
+
+### Starting / stopping timers
+- [ ] `start(name)` begins a timer with the given name -> test: after start, a running entry with that name exists
+- [ ] `stop()` stops the running timer and sets its `stop` time -> test: after stop, entry has a defined stop time
+- [ ] Starting a new timer while one runs auto-stops the previous -> test: start A, start B; A has stop time, B is running
+- [ ] `start` returns the created entry -> test: returned object has name + start
+- [ ] `stop` returns the stopped entry -> test: returned object has stop time
+
+### Recording entries
+- [ ] Each entry captures name, start (ms epoch), and stop (ms or undefined) -> test: shape assertions
+- [ ] Running entry has stop === undefined -> test: assert undefined after start
+
+### Persistence
+- [ ] Data saved to configurable JSON file path -> test: after ops, file exists and parses
+- [ ] Parent directories created automatically -> test: nested non-existent path works
+- [ ] New tracker loads existing data from file -> test: second instance sees prior entries
+- [ ] Missing file => starts empty (no throw) -> test: fresh path, getEntries() === []
+
+### Querying
+- [ ] `getEntries()` returns all entries -> test: count matches
+- [ ] `getEntries({ from, to })` filters by date range (overlap by start time) -> test: only in-range returned
+- [ ] Filtering with only `from` or only `to` works -> test: open-ended ranges
+
+### Summarizing
+- [ ] `summary()` returns map of name -> total ms -> test: known durations sum correctly
+- [ ] Same name across entries summed -> test: two entries same name added
+- [ ] Running task uses current time for duration -> test: running entry contributes (now - start)
+- [ ] Unicode/emoji names summed correctly -> test: emoji key present with correct total
+
+### Error handling
+- [ ] `start('')` throws -> test: expect throw
+- [ ] `start('   ')` (whitespace only) throws -> test: expect throw
+- [ ] `stop()` with nothing running throws -> test: expect throw
+
+### Unicode
+- [ ] Unicode + emoji names round-trip through persistence -> test: reload preserves name
+
+## Done
+- [ ] `npm run build` clean
+- [ ] `npm run lint` clean
+- [ ] `npm test` all pass
